  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-rabi-default-persona",
      "text": "通过设置中的“Rabi”页面连接 Rabi Manager，选择并启用全局人格。聊天侧栏不再提供“计划”入口。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "锁定公开仓库的提交后，通过 DSH 官方入口安装：\n\n```powershell\npnpm dsh plugin --profile web add github:vb2250158/dsh-rabi-default-persona#<commit>\n```\n\n插件包声明 `dsh.bundle`，安装后会把自己的配置层加入 profile。"
    },
    {
      "section": "配置",
      "text": "插件配置保存在 DSH profile 的 `cordis.patch.yml`。多电脑同步仓库只保存仓库地址、固定提交、启停状态和配置，不保存本仓库源码。"
    },
    {
      "section": "验证",
      "text": "```powershell\nnpm test\nnpm run build\nnpm pack --dry-run\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "许可证",
      "text": "MIT\n\nLocal integration retains the additional personaPrompt field and editor alongside the Manager binding. The additional prompt is appended independently of the Manager binding switch; the profile loader still owns whether this plugin is enabled."
    }
  ],
